<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Mar 12.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Mar 12.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1515 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to Liverpool Mar 115.00</p>
<p>Yorkshire Apr/Jun 114.00</p>
<p>Midlands Apr 113.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to West Norfolk Apr/Jun 101.00</p>
<p>Liverpool Apr 102.00</p>
<p>Tilbury Mar 99.00</p>
<p>Suffolk/Essex Mar 99.00</p>
<p>Norfolk/Suffolk Apr/Jun 101.50 asa 92.25/92.50</p>
<p>Cheshire/Shropshire Apr 99.50/100.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Norfolk/Suffolk Mar 96.00 Apr/Jun 98.00/97.50</p>
